Fixed type hints of :meth:`~icalendar.timezone.tzp.TZP.localize` and :meth:`~icalendar.timezone.tzp.TZP.localize_utc` so they consistently accept :class:`datetime.date`, :class:`datetime.datetime`, and :class:`datetime.time`. Both now return a ``datetime`` for ``date``/``datetime`` input and a ``time`` for ``time`` input. ``TZP.localize(some_date, None)`` no longer raises :exc:`TypeError`. @SUJAYSAKHARE22